        >
          <h2>
            Get in touch!
          </h2>
          <button
            style="border: 3px solid blue; background-color: lightblue; border-radius: 1em; width: 100%;"
          >
            Send an email
          </button>
        </div>
        <div
          style="position: fixed; right: 40px; bottom: 40px; background: white; border: 2px solid black; cursor: pointer; z-index: 100;"
        >
          <img
            alt="Contact Us Window Pop-up Button Gif of Typewriter Cartoon"
            height="60"
            src="/src/assets/ContactUs.gif"
            width="100"
          />
        </div>
        <div
          style="padding: 10px 10px 10px 1em; color: black; background-color: white; font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 36px); overflow-wrap: anywhere;"
        >
          Solar Power - Industrial Insights
        </div>
        <div
          style="margin: auto; padding-left: 2em; padding-right: 2em;"
        >
          <img
            alt="Cartoon outline of the Earth"
            height="60"
